WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.300
Desktop recording. Invented data only. No sign-in is required.

00:03.300 --> 00:05.300
A repeated local time requires an explicit UTC offset.

00:05.300 --> 00:09.500
Save the profile and calculate a chart under the displayed method.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.800
The question stays attached to this chart. Missing source evidence leads to abstention.

00:12.800 --> 00:16.000
Inspect source limitations and the library's unavailable-search state.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.000
Review data controls. The privacy worker completes an expiring export.

00:21.000 --> 00:23.900
Confirm deletion. Access is revoked and background deletion is queued.
